  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your intuition for truth is penetrating indeed.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Unsanctioned Detection<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may use the normal benefit of this feat a number of times per day equal to your mythic tier. In addition, as a swift action you expend one use of your mythic power to alter your ability to detect evil to allow you to detect chaos, detect good, detect law, detect undead, or detect outsider. This latter ability functions identically to detect undead, but applies to only one outsider subtype (which may be a general type, such as fire or evil, or a specific outsider race such as devil or qlippoth), which you must choose at the time you activate this feat. This new type of detection functions like and replaces your normal detect evil ability for the next 24 hours or until you dismiss the change as a standard action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc24\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
